    {
      "flavor_text": "When Mesprit flew, people learned\nthe joy and sadness of living.\nIt was the birth of emotions.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "white-2",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/22/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "かなしみの　くるしさと　よろこびの\nとうとさを　ひとびとに　おしえた。\nかんじょうのかみ　と　よばれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "슬픔의 괴로움과 즐거움의 소중함을\n사람들에게 가르쳐 주었다.\n감정의 신이라 불리고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "On l’appelle « être de l’émotion ». Il enseigne aux\nhommes la beauté de la tristesse, la douleur et la\njoie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "„Das fühlende Wesen“. Es lehrt die Menschen\ndie Ideale von Trauer, Schmerz und Freude.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se le conoce como el Ser de la Emoción. Enseñó a los\nhumanos la nobleza del dolor y la alegría.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Detto “Essere delle emozioni”. Ha insegnato agli\nuomini la nobiltà di tristezza, gioia e dolore.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Known as “The Being of Emotion.” It taught\nhumans the nobility of sorrow, pain, and joy.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "悲しみの　苦しさと　喜びの　尊さを\n人々に　教えた。\n感情の神と　呼ばれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se le conoce como el Ser de la Emoción. Enseñó a los\nhumanos la nobleza del dolor y la alegría.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "みずうみの　そこで　ねむっているが\nたましいが　ぬけだして　すいめんを\nとびまわると　いわれている。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "호수의 밑바닥에서 잠자고 있지만\n영혼이 빠져나가서 수면을\n날아다닌다고 전해진다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il dort au fond d’un lac. On dit que son esprit\nabandonne son corps pour voler à sa surface.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es schläft auf dem Grund eines Sees. Man sagt, sein\nGeist verlasse den Körper und fliege über den See.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Duerme en el fondo de un lago. Se dice que su\nespíritu deja el cuerpo para volar sobre el agua.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dorme sul fondo di un lago. Si dice che il suo spirito\nabbandoni il corpo per volare in superficie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It sleeps at the bottom of a lake. Its spirit is said to\nleave its body to fly on the lake’s surface.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
